msgid "Miniature Golf"
msgstr "Minigolf"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kolf.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Kolf is a miniature golf game. The game is played from an overhead view, with a short bar representing the golf club. Kolf features many different types of objects, such water hazards, slopes, sand traps, and black holes (warps), among others."
msgstr "Kolf je igra minigolfa koja se igra iz ptičje perspektive; kratka crta predstavlja palicu za golf. Kolf nudi razne objekte, među ostalim vodene prepreke, padine, pješčane zamke i crne rupe (teleportere)."

